{
  "name": "Alexandria Workspace Window Architecture",
  "description": "Visual architecture of the Alexandria Workspace window - multi-repository workspace management with panel-based UI and persistent storage",
  "markdown": ".principal-views/alexandria-workspace-window.md",
  "display": {
    "layout": "manual",
    "theme": {
      "primary": "#8b5cf6",
      "success": "#22c55e",
      "danger": "#ef4444",
      "warning": "#eab308",
      "info": "#06b6d4"
    }
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Alexandria Workspace Window\n\nMulti-repository workspace management with panel-based UI",
      "x": 300,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#8b5cf6",
      "pv": {
        "name": "Alexandria Workspace Overview"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "workspace-app",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# AlexandriaWorkspaceApp\n\n**Entry Point:**\n`src/renderer/alexandria-workspace/`\n\n- Parses window hash data\n- Loads workspace from ID\n- Manages titlebar state\n- Coordinates layout & collapse",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "#22c55e",
      "pv": {
        "icon": "AppWindow",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "name": "Workspace App",
        "references": [
          "src/renderer/alexandria-workspace/AlexandriaWorkspaceApp.tsx"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "workspace-layout",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# AlexandriaWorkspaceLayout\n\n**Panel Framework:**\n- Three-panel layout (left/middle/right)\n- Collapsible sidebars\n- Panel switching via sidebar\n- Event-driven communication\n\n**Default Layout:**\n- Left: workspace-repos\n- Middle: terminal\n- Right: file-city",
      "x": 350,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "#22c55e",
      "pv": {
        "icon": "Layout",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "name": "Workspace Layout",
        "references": [
          "src/renderer/alexandria-workspace/AlexandriaWorkspaceLayout.tsx"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "panel-sidebar",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# PanelIconSidebar\n\n**Position:** Right side\n**Icons for panels:**\n- Info (packageComposition)\n- Quality (codeQuality)\n- Stories (canvasList)\n- Docs\n- Agents\n- Files (gitChanges)\n- Backlog (kanban)\n- Traces",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "#06b6d4",
      "pv": {
        "icon": "LayoutList",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "name": "Panel Sidebar",
        "references": [
          "src/renderer/components/Sidebar/PanelIconSidebar.tsx"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "panel-provider",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# PanelProvider Context\n\n**Provides to all panels:**\n- `context` - data slices\n- `actions` - mutations\n- `events` - PanelEventBus\n\n**Scopes:**\n- Workspace metadata\n- Selected repository\n- Terminal context",
      "x": 350,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "#eab308",
      "pv": {
        "icon": "Layers",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "name": "Panel Provider",
        "references": [
          "src/renderer/contexts/PanelContext.tsx"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "main-process",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Main Process\n\n**WorkspaceApiEventHandler**\nIPC bridge for workspace operations\n\n**Handles:**\n- CRUD operations\n- Membership changes\n- Repository watching\n- Event broadcasting",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "#ef4444",
      "pv": {
        "icon": "Server",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "name": "Main Process Handler",
        "references": [
          "src/main/stores/WorkspaceApiEventHandler.ts"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "registry-service",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# AlexandriaRegistryService\n\n**Singleton** wrapping OutpostManager\n\n**Manages:**\n- Repository entries\n- Workspace CRUD\n- Membership relations\n- GitHub metadata\n\n**Delegates to:**\n`outpostManager.workspaces.*`",
      "x": 350,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "#ef4444",
      "pv": {
        "icon": "Database",
        "shape": "hexagon",
        "name": "Registry Service",
        "references": [
          "src/main/stores/AlexandriaRegistryService.ts"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "storage",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Storage Location\n\n**~/.alexandria/**\n\n```\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 registry.json    # Repositories\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 workspaces.json  # Workspaces\n```\n\n**Powered by:**\n`@principal-ai/alexandria-core-library`\n`AlexandriaOutpostManager`",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "#8b5cf6",
      "pv": {
        "icon": "HardDrive",
        "shape": "cylinder",
        "name": "File Storage"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "renderer-service",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# WorkspaceService (Renderer)\n\n**IPC Client** for workspace ops\n\n```typescript\nWorkspaceService.getWorkspaces()\nWorkspaceService.createWorkspace()\nWorkspaceService.addRepository()\n```\n\nAll calls go through\n`window.mainProcess.workspace.*`",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "#06b6d4",
      "pv": {
        "icon": "Plug",
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "name": "Renderer Service",
        "references": [
          "src/renderer/main-process-api/WorkspaceService.ts"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "workspace-model",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Workspace Data Model\n\n```typescript\ninterface Workspace {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n  suggestedClonePath?: string;\n  description?: string;\n  theme?: string;\n  isDefault?: boolean;\n}\n\ninterface WorkspaceMembership {\n  workspaceId: string;\n  repositoryId: string;\n  addedAt: string;\n}\n```",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "#eab308",
      "pv": {
        "icon": "FileJson",
        "name": "Data Model"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "events",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Event Flow\n\n**Panel Events:**\n- `repository:selected`\n- `repository:opened`\n- `file:opened`\n- `doc:openInRightPanel`\n\n**IPC Events:**\n- `WORKSPACE_ADDED`\n- `WORKSPACE_UPDATED`\n- `MEMBERSHIP_CHANGED`",
      "x": 1070,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "#06b6d4",
      "pv": {
        "icon": "Radio",
        "name": "Events"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "available-panels",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Available Panels\n\n**Left slot:**\n- Workspace Repos\n- Local Projects\n- Kanban/Backlog\n- GitHub Issues\n- Git Changes\n\n**Middle slot:**\n- Terminal (tabbed)\n\n**Right slot:**\n- File City\n- Documentation\n- Markdown Viewer\n- Localhost Browser",
      "x": 1070,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "#22c55e",
      "pv": {
        "icon": "PanelLeft",
        "name": "Panels"
      }
    }
  ],
